Veritas-AI
Feature 1: Fake vs Genuine News Classification

This document describes Feature 1 of Veritas-AI — a machine-learning–based system that classifies news text as Fake or Genuine and returns a confidence score.
This feature is fully implemented, tested, and exposed through a REST API.

🎯 Feature Objective

To build a reliable and reusable backend service that:

Accepts raw news text

Analyzes linguistic patterns using NLP

Classifies the text as Fake or Genuine

Returns a confidence percentage

Exposes results through a FastAPI endpoint

This feature serves as the foundation for future components such as explainability, credibility scoring, and dashboards.

